WEBVTT

00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:22.961
Wake up!
You'll be late for school!

00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:34.597
Yeah, Mom!

00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:39.978
What? Is he still asleep?

00:00:40.186 --> 00:00:42.730
Yes! He never listens to me!

00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:47.193
I've told him he should wake up
at least 30 minutes before breakfast.

00:00:50.446 --> 00:00:51.322
Ten-hut!

00:01:05.795 --> 00:01:11.801
City of Cannons

00:01:13.511 --> 00:01:14.804
Hurry UP!

00:01:16.931 --> 00:01:20.310
Coming!

00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:30.737
Hut-two! Hut-two!
Hut-two! Good morning.

00:01:32.071 --> 00:01:35.450
Why can't you get up any earlier?

00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:38.620
Only you skip morning drills, Monday,
Wednesday, and Friday!

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:44.167
I know it isn't required,
but it affects your grades!

00:01:45.001 --> 00:01:49.172
You really have to earn
that scholarship for next semester.

00:01:49.547 --> 00:01:53.718
Your tuition goes up every year,
and your dad's salary isn't following it.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.558
Hey, Mom! Mom!

00:02:00.642 --> 00:02:03.645
Can I have a music helmet?
I want a music helmet!

00:02:03.895 --> 00:02:06.189
Those were banned at
the last PTA meeting.

00:02:06.356 --> 00:02:07.649
They're too dangerous.

00:02:08.107 --> 00:02:12.528
But everybody has one!
Even the kid next to me in school.

00:02:12.904 --> 00:02:16.157
You never listen to me.
Your grades stay the same.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:19.243
You don't go to training.
You're too behind for a scholarship!

00:02:19.369 --> 00:02:22.622
You can't expect us
to buy you what you want!

00:02:22.747 --> 00:02:23.998
Right, dear?

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:26.959
Yeah.

00:02:27.168 --> 00:02:30.588
<i>Today's wind is from
the west at force level five.</i>

00:02:30.797 --> 00:02:32.924
Okay, they're ready. For you.

00:02:33.841 --> 00:02:34.509
And for you.

00:02:39.305 --> 00:02:42.058
Hurry up or we'll miss the number 7, Dad!

00:02:44.102 --> 00:02:47.313
Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:53.861
I'm off to shoot.

00:02:57.824 --> 00:02:59.742
Ready to fire!

00:03:18.052 --> 00:03:22.515
<i>Train to Cannon Number 17
now arriving on Platform 1.</i>

00:03:22.682 --> 00:03:28.104
<i>This is East 17th Station.
This is East 17th Station.</i>

00:04:13.107 --> 00:04:18.571
<i>17th Cannon Station.
17th Cannon Station.</i>

00:04:44.263 --> 00:04:48.267
<i>Shoot and blast with all
your strength for our nation.</i>

00:04:48.476 --> 00:04:52.522
<i>Shoot and blast with all
your strength for our nation.</i>

00:04:55.149 --> 00:05:00.488
Why was Cannon 8's Life Quality
Committee hauled up on charges?

00:05:00.696 --> 00:05:02.782
Heard they was in bed
with the higher-ups.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.534
Five minutes to roll call!

00:05:04.659 --> 00:05:06.369
Everyone into the hall, now.

00:05:06.953 --> 00:05:09.288
No discipline, no victory!

00:05:10.081 --> 00:05:11.666
We've got to give it all we've got!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.461
Shoot and blast with all
your strength for our nation!

00:05:21.884 --> 00:05:27.181
And thus, through the trigonomic functions
of sine, cosine, and tangent,

00:05:27.223 --> 00:05:32.311
we can calculate the
theoretical position of our target.

00:05:32.562 --> 00:05:35.398
However, to achieve even
greater accuracy,

00:05:35.606 --> 00:05:39.235
we must account for the
external factors which create aberrations.

00:05:39.402 --> 00:05:44.240
Weather factors, such as wind speed and
direction, affect the trajectory of the shot.

00:05:44.407 --> 00:05:50.955
Likewise, temperature and humidity
can affect the gunpowder's combustion.

00:05:51.163 --> 00:05:54.333
This will be covered
in your chemistry class.

00:06:30.411 --> 00:06:32.914
<i>Dispatch from HQ, as of 9:20 today.</i>

00:06:33.372 --> 00:06:34.916
<i>Target data follows.</i>

00:06:35.124 --> 00:06:38.461
<i>Direction: 2 o'clock and 15 minutes.
Launching angle: 42 degrees.</i>

00:06:40.254 --> 00:06:43.341
Everybody in line.
Roll call completed!

00:06:43.633 --> 00:06:46.302
Begin loading cannon!

00:06:53.392 --> 00:06:56.145
Bring in shells number one and two!

00:07:01.233 --> 00:07:04.362
- Lower the crane!
- Lower the crane!

00:07:06.572 --> 00:07:08.366
Lowering crane!

00:07:24.674 --> 00:07:26.258
Hook attached!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.718
Okay, everybody stand clear!

00:07:29.303 --> 00:07:32.640
- Raise the crane!
- Raising crane!

00:07:37.645 --> 00:07:40.815
- Back up crane!
- Backing up crane!

00:07:45.236 --> 00:07:48.864
- Lower the shell!
- Lowering shell!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.159
Detach hook!

00:07:54.161 --> 00:07:55.538
Hook detached!

00:07:56.122 --> 00:07:59.500
- Loading car, forward!
- Loading car, forward!

00:08:02.336 --> 00:08:05.297
- Load shell!
- Loading shell!

00:08:05.506 --> 00:08:08.217
Powder charge in loading position.

00:08:08.384 --> 00:08:09.844
Back up loading car.

00:08:12.013 --> 00:08:15.683
- Lower powder charge!
- Lowering powder charge!

00:08:18.436 --> 00:08:21.689
- Release hook!
- Hook released.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.109
- Load powder charge!
- Loading!

00:08:28.904 --> 00:08:30.448
Powder charge loaded!

00:08:33.367 --> 00:08:36.787
- Seal the breech.
- Sealing the breech.

00:08:37.997 --> 00:08:41.125
Fire control, loading complete.

00:08:41.959 --> 00:08:45.004
<i>Rogen
Commencing cannon alignment.</i>

00:08:45.463 --> 00:08:48.132
<i>Increase steam pressure
to 90 percent!</i>

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.760
Increasing pressure to 90 percent.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:57.391
- Close valves <i>5</i> and 6!
- Valves 5 and 6 closed!

00:09:01.312 --> 00:09:05.024
<i>Fire control, steam pressure is
now at 70 percent.</i>

00:09:05.232 --> 00:09:07.651
<i>Thirty seconds to activation level.</i>

00:09:09.153 --> 00:09:12.114
All right, take us down
to the cannon floor.

00:09:12.782 --> 00:09:15.451
Descending to cannon floor, sir.

00:09:26.712 --> 00:09:28.964
Turret operator, confirm
direction of target.

00:09:29.131 --> 00:09:30.633
Direction: 2 o'clock, 15 minutes.

00:09:30.674 --> 00:09:33.803
Weather adjustment: minus 0.2 degrees.

00:09:34.011 --> 00:09:37.139
<i>Direction: 2 o'clock, 15 minutes.
Adjustment: minus 0.2 degrees.</i>

00:09:37.139 --> 00:09:38.933
<i>Confirmed. Ready to rotate.</i>

00:09:39.141 --> 00:09:42.853
- How's the pressure? You ready?
- Yes, sir!

00:09:44.063 --> 00:09:45.815
Okay! Begin rotation!

00:09:58.494 --> 00:10:00.287
<i>Launching angle: 42 degrees!</i>

00:10:04.041 --> 00:10:06.794
42 degrees, confirmed!

00:10:07.711 --> 00:10:10.673
Weather adjustment:
plus 0.1 degrees.

00:10:10.965 --> 00:10:14.468
Adjustment: plus 0.1 degrees.

00:10:15.177 --> 00:10:19.473
<i>Ready to fire. Evacuate cannon floor!</i>

00:10:20.182 --> 00:10:24.061
All personnel, evacuate!
All personnel, evacuate!

00:10:26.105 --> 00:10:28.399
Evacuate! Evacuate!

00:10:54.466 --> 00:10:57.761
<i>Ready for cannon ascension.
ls the pressure all right?</i>

00:10:57.845 --> 00:10:58.929
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:11:00.264 --> 00:11:01.098
<i>Hurry UP!</i>

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.650
Open valve number seven!

00:11:13.194 --> 00:11:15.696
We are at pressure!

00:12:03.661 --> 00:12:05.621
<i>Thirty seconds to firing!</i>

00:12:05.829 --> 00:12:08.958
<i>All personnel, take positions
for shock wave!</i>

00:13:07.725 --> 00:13:08.976
Fire!

00:13:41.091 --> 00:13:44.511
Cease work! Lunchtime!

00:13:45.012 --> 00:13:48.640
Eat as quickly as possible
and get back to work!

00:13:49.016 --> 00:13:52.311
There is no lunch break
in the enemy's attack.

00:14:00.235 --> 00:14:05.032
We demand they use
non-toxic gunpowder!

00:14:06.241 --> 00:14:11.830
We deserve the right to work
under safe and healthy conditions!

00:14:12.331 --> 00:14:18.921
However, the gunpowder we now use
contains harmful substances.

00:14:20.422 --> 00:14:21.548
Here, take one.

00:15:27.281 --> 00:15:31.910
- The chief really did that?
- He did! That's why he was transferred.

00:15:31.952 --> 00:15:34.621
I heard it was because
his wife is almost due.

00:15:34.705 --> 00:15:37.082
The baby might end up
with a mustache!

00:15:37.374 --> 00:15:41.712
That's okay. His other kids don't
look like him anyway!

00:15:41.753 --> 00:15:44.756
I've never seen brothers
as unlike each other as that.

00:15:44.798 --> 00:15:47.593
And besides that,
his wife is unbelievable!

00:15:47.634 --> 00:15:48.719
Yeah!

00:16:02.274 --> 00:16:04.109
<i>Barrel cleaning completed!</i>

00:16:04.693 --> 00:16:07.154
<i>Get ready to load the third shell!</i>

00:16:16.497 --> 00:16:19.458
- Lower crane!
- Lowering crane!

00:16:21.502 --> 00:16:23.295
Bring down the shell tip!

00:16:26.924 --> 00:16:29.927
You idiot!
What the hell are you doing?

00:16:30.719 --> 00:16:34.097
You must have forgotten
to check something!

00:16:34.515 --> 00:16:37.643
One little mistake will end in death!

00:16:37.976 --> 00:16:39.269
Yes, load commander!

00:16:39.436 --> 00:16:41.271
Your team is to remain on the floor!

00:16:42.606 --> 00:16:44.483
<i>Cannon now loaded.</i>

00:16:44.858 --> 00:16:46.860
<i>All personnel, evacuate!</i>

00:16:47.361 --> 00:16:48.278
Hurry UP!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.240
Hurry UP!

00:17:22.896 --> 00:17:24.439
<i>Ten seconds to firing.</i>

00:17:24.898 --> 00:17:27.067
<i>All personnel, brace for shock wave!</i>

00:17:34.908 --> 00:17:36.660
<i>Fire!</i>

00:18:26.877 --> 00:18:30.255
<i>And now, today's war report
from headquarters.</i>

00:18:30.422 --> 00:18:35.093
<i>Number of rounds fired:
Cannon 3: three. Cannon 7: three.</i>

00:18:35.385 --> 00:18:38.221
<i>Cannons 8 and 10: one each.</i>

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.933
<i>Cannons 15 and 17: four each.</i>

00:18:42.809 --> 00:18:44.811
<i>Damage to the enemy's moving city:</i>

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:51.109
<i>Five major hits, seven medium,
one light, one unconfirmed.</i>

00:18:51.443 --> 00:18:54.279
<i>We have inflicted
tremendous damage!</i>

00:18:54.488 --> 00:18:56.239
<i>Our victory will soon come.</i>

00:18:56.907 --> 00:19:02.204
<i>Shoot and blast with all
your strength for our nation.</i>

00:19:02.412 --> 00:19:05.749
<i>Shoot and blast with all
your strength for our nation.</i>

00:19:07.793 --> 00:19:09.670
<i>The Cannon Family again'?</i>

00:19:11.672 --> 00:19:13.548
Bang! Bang!

00:19:15.634 --> 00:19:16.593
It's stupid.

00:19:16.843 --> 00:19:19.930
You should go to bed.
It'll be lights out soon.

00:19:20.555 --> 00:19:24.935
Dad, can I ask you something?
Who are we fighting?

00:19:25.519 --> 00:19:27.771
You'll understand when you get bigger.

00:19:28.313 --> 00:19:29.147
Now go to bed.

00:19:30.148 --> 00:19:31.066
Yes, Dad!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.644
Fire!

00:20:15.527 --> 00:20:16.611
All right!

00:20:25.787 --> 00:20:26.621
Ten-hut!

00:20:34.087 --> 00:20:35.380
Forward!

00:21:08.705 --> 00:21:11.792
When I grow up, I want to be
the one who fires the gun.

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:14.669
Not just a cannon loader like my dad.

00:21:15.212 --> 00:21:16.129
Ten-hut!
